{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And when a sojourner sojourns with you.</b> It is mentioned after the elder, and the reason is: just as I warned you to honor the elder who is an Israelite because he has no strength, so I warn you concerning the sojourner, for your strength is greater than his, or because he has no strength, since he is in your land under your authority."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:13.449627491Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}